<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{!location}}" class="empty"><text class="heading">先告诉我你在哪里</text><text class="desc">选择所在地区后，才会按当地演示天气从衣橱里搭配。</text><button class="primary" bindtap="chooseRegion">选择地区</button></view><block wx:else><text class="eyebrow">{{location.fullName}} · {{weather.condition}} · {{weather.low}}–{{weather.high}}°C · 演示天气</text><text class="heading">今天可以这样穿</text><view wx:if="{{recommendation.items.length}}" class="outfit-card"><view class="outfit-art"><text wx:for="{{recommendation.items}}" wx:key="id">{{item.name}}</text></view><text class="title">{{recommendation.items.length > 1 ? '今日搭配建议' : '今日单品建议'}}</text><text class="desc">{{weather.tip}}</text><view class="tags"><text>已有衣物</text><text>按温度筛选</text></view></view><view wx:else class="outfit-card"><text class="title">衣橱暂时缺少适合今天的完整搭配</text><text class="desc">建议补充：{{recommendation.missing.join('、')}}</text></view><button class="primary" bindtap="toWardrobe">去衣橱看看</button></block><button class="ghost" bindtap="goBack">回到首页</button></view>
